    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there are no small steps. i feel like i've tried everything. i thought if i just shut the world out, the pain would stop, but it just stayed right here with me. it's like i'm trapped in this loop and there's no way to fix it from the inside. it just feels like the cage is part of me now. like there is no version of this where i actually feel free again.",
